 started this cycle, which historically means the larger trend is rolling over (~80% of cases). Last cycle was left-translated (topped early) \u2014 a bearish structural tell.", "next": "Stand aside until a new daily cycle low forms and confirms.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "bear", "regime_label": "BEARISH", "regime_why": "weekly momentum positive; but rolling toward a weekly cross-down; investor cycle failed (broke its start low); last cycle left-translated (topped early)", "regime_score": -2.0, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: BEARISH \u2014 weekly momentum positive; but rolling toward a weekly cross-down; investor cycle failed (broke its start low); last cycle left-translated (topped early) (investor cycle week 9 \u00b7 failed \u00b7 daily cycle broke its start low 7d ago).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): downtrend. Bigger picture (counter-trend): bearish.", "points": ["Bigger picture is bearish (counter-trend for a daily long)", "Macro: US net liquidity neutral \u2014 no macro tilt on the odds", "\u26a0 Failed cycle \u2014 price broke below the low that began this cycle (7d ago)", "Still below the 10-day average", "Prior cycle topped early (a tiring-trend hint)"], "entry": {"tag": "AVOID", "tag_zh": "\u56de\u907f", "urgency": "avoid", "text": "Downtrend \u2014 stand aside until a new cycle low forms and confirms.", "text_zh": "\u4e0b\u8dcc\u8d8b\u52bf\u2014\u2014\u89c2\u671b\uff0c\u76f4\u81f3\u65b0\u7684\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9\u5f62\u6210\u5e76\u786e\u8ba4\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 39 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "inside the window where a low is due", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 39 \u5929\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 36\u201342 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5", "daily_phase_zh": "\u5904\u4e8e\u4f4e\u70b9\u5e94\u5f53\u51fa\u73b0\u7684\u65f6\u95f4\u7a97\u53e3\u5185", "weekly_line": "Weekly (investor) cycle: week 9 of a typical 16\u201326 weeks", "weekly_phase": "mid \u20